  "description": {
    "raw": "The transmuted creature becomes wiser. The spell grants a +4 enhancement bonus to Wisdom, adding the usual benefit to Wisdom-related skills. Clerics, druids, and rangers (and other Wisdom-based spellcasters) who receive owl's wisdom do not gain any additional bonus spells for the increased Wisdom, but the save DCs for their spells increase.",
    "search_text": "\"the transmuted creature becomes wiser. the spell grants a +4 enhancement bonus to wisdom, adding the usual benefit to wisdom-related skills. clerics, druids, and rangers (and other wisdom-based spellcasters) who receive owl's wisdom do not gain any additional bonus spells for the increased wisdom, but the save dcs for their spells increase.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
